=9ivc 提取码: 9ivc </p></blockquote><ul><li id=\"VVrcd5XcpoT4sAx2Xc5cl4JdnTh\">切换Buffer后去通知</li></ul><p id=\"UOuDdFsgXoXqLJxPyxGc4XLVnOh\">录制文件：https://meeting.tencent.com/crm/NxgmzeJ974</p><p id=\"XvpJdEzB2o1Z5pxp0kOcch9Gn6c\">密码：EXZW</p><figure id=\"EAHfdULG5omeXZxyD2ZcX0qVn7e\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"UIn3dGmLpowLjsxUT1PcxZGtncb\" name=\"07_freeRTOS_uart1_V6.7z\" mime=\"application/x-compressed\" size=\"8477873\" token=\"FjA8bXTpdo6KTVxaidIczkgLnIc\"/></figure><blockquote id=\"LPFndZF07orf00x7Zu3cUtYNnTe\"><p id=\"WPD2dTyd9o0ZbPxu8vBcvra2nBb\">通过网盘分享的文件：07_freeRTOS_uart1_V6.7z</p><p id=\"E4NAd158PoxQxsx1xqdcDV1mnCb\">链接: https://pan.baidu.com/s/1bsmFOnoK-CgeGCf9RNBcMQ?pwd=5f9s 提取码: 5f9s </p></blockquote><h2 id=\"OfV7dbd56ouxm1xYbLWcFo8Snob\">QA:<cite doc-id=\"E4b1d86kEo1ZA5xsZW1cyIRin9c\" file-type=\"docx\" title=\"“07_freeRTOS_uart1_V6”demo工程文件，发现串口打印不全\" type=\"doc\"></cite></h2><h1 id=\"Gy8Tdg41uo0hpKxjiArcyKYpnWe\">本节参考（完成后再看）</h1><p id=\"KKhGdL1wKoJgjhxpunocpAyKnIb\"><cite doc-id=\"OS4SdSB7PorJn4xFa4Kc380Nn8c\" file-type=\"docx\" title=\"15-1_参考代码介绍_初阶_ADC采集和DMA传输模式\" type=\"doc\"></cite></p><p id=\"GyF1dSm0Ho8pumxGHV0cCs2knQc\"></p>",
